# Build artifacts. Directory-only glob (trailing slash) so a *file* named
# build*.sh is never swallowed. 2026-10-10: build-dbg/ and build2/ slipped past
# build/ and build_*/ for days -- build-dbg's engine.cpp.o was 4h older than
# its source, so a never-compiled tree sat beside the working tree and read as
# a live build. A stale artifact must not be mistakeable for a live one.
build*/
.cache/
compile_commands.json

# Agent internal state
.maki/

# Generated quantized-model artifacts (large binaries; rebuild via scripts)
*.intfer
*.intifer
*.dequant.bin
*.unrot.dump
*.noembed.intfer
*.noembed.dequant.bin

# Editor / OS noise
*.swp
.DS_Store

# Python bytecode
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Local secrets (API keys); never commit
.envrc
*.gguf
